<title>USA: Great Train Q2 same-store sales off.</title>
<headline>Great Train Q2 same-store sales off.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>			   1997    1996    Total   Same-store</p>
<p>Quarter		$ 4.015 $ 2.766   +45.2     -6.7</p>
<p>Year-to-date	   7.905   5.187   +52.4     -3.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in millions, except percentage. Year-to-date is 26 weeks ended July 29, 1997. Year-to-date comparable sales were $4.805 million compared with $4.951 million for same period in 1996. Company attributed lower sales in 1997 second quarter to poor mall traffic in a number of its locations. Full company name is Great Train Store Co.</p>
</text>
